  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>calories</mi></math>&nbsp;of heat is given to a heat engine, and it rejects <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>225</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>calories</mi></math>&nbsp;of heat. If source temperature is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>227</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, then the temperature of sink will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#8728;</mo></mmultiscripts><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "102",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8a043fcb-ad0c-4e9a-b6f1-830e8905b6d0-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 186px;\" /></p><p>Efficiency of Carnot engine is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>225</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>500</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>375</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>So, temperature of sink is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>375</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>102</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>",
